(20, 'Web Development — Complete 90 Days Internship', 'web-development-complete-90-days-internship', 'A complete 90-days Beginner level Web Development Internship . Covers all fundamentals to advanced topics .', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.00, 'Remote', 13, '/uploads/internships/internship_69edfec7629ff_1777204935.png', 'beginner', 'Web Development', 0, NULL, 10.00, NULL, NULL, '1. Basic Knowledge of HTML, CSS & JavaScript\nFundamental understanding of web technologies to create and style simple web pages.\n\n2. Understanding of Web Basics\nFamiliarity with how websites work, including browsers, domains, and hosting.\n\n3. Version Control (Git) Basics\nBasic knowledge of Git for managing code and collaborating on projects.\n\n4. Problem Solving Skills\nAbility to think logically and solve basic coding challenges.\n\n5. Eagerness to Learn\nWillingness to learn new tools, technologies, and improve skills continuously.\n\n6. Basic Computer Skills\nComfortable using a computer, internet, and simple software tools.\n\n7. Good Communication Skills\nAbility to understand instructions and communicate ideas clearly.', NULL, NULL, '“No prior professional experience required. Only willingness to learn is enough to get started.”', NULL, '2026-04-07 09:00:24', '2026-05-03 16:40:21'),
