INSERT INTO `internship_content_blocks` (`id`, `lesson_id`, `type`, `content`, `title`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, 1, 'text', '<div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 12px;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pAnGwRiQ4-4\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border-style: initial; border-color: initial;\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>Tum implicitly ye maan rahe the ki “size remove kar dene se logo naturally responsive ho jaayega.” Ye assumption weak hai.<p>Browser image ko <em>intrinsic size</em> par render karta hai — jo aksar desktop ke liye too big aur mobile ke liye awkward hota hai. Responsiveness ka matlab “no size” nahi hota, balki <strong>context-aware scaling</strong> hota hai.</p><p>Tumhe aisa control chahiye jo:</p><ul><li><p>Mobile par logo compact rahe</p></li><li><p>Desktop par thoda presence rakhe</p></li><li><p>Aspect ratio kabhi na tode</p></li><li><p>Header ka layout break na kare</p></li></ul><p>Iske liye Tailwind ka responsive scaling use karo:</p><pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;!-- Logo --&gt;\n&lt;div class=\"flex items-center\"&gt;\n    &lt;img \n        src=\"icon.png\" \n        alt=\"InternshipAdda Logo\"\n        class=\"w-auto max-h-8 sm:max-h-10 md:max-h-12 lg:max-h-14\"\n    &gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n</code></pre><p>Logic:</p><ul><li><p><code inline=\"\">max-h-8</code> → mobile me compact</p></li><li><p><code inline=\"\">sm:max-h-10</code> → small screens</p></li><li><p><code inline=\"\">md:max-h-12</code> → tablet</p></li><li><p><code inline=\"\">lg:max-h-14</code> → desktop</p></li></ul><p>Yahan tum logo ko “box me band” nahi kar rahe, balki <strong>upper bound</strong> de rahe ho.<br>Image apna natural proportion rakhegi, lekin kabhi layout ko todne layak badi nahi hogi.</p><p>Ye approach design-first hai, widget-first nahi.<br><br><br>local image uplaod&nbsp;<br><br><img src=\"/public/uploads/images/media_6979ce5087ca4_1769590352.png\" alt=\"Uploaded image\"></p><p><br></p><p>onlien image uplaod&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>local video uplaod<br><br><video controls=\"\"><source src=\"/public/uploads/videos/media_6979cecd0138d_1769590477.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><br><br></p>', NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 08:54:56', '2026-01-28 08:54:56'),
(2, 2, 'text', 'ey ahi lesson 2n dsopdjsoefjoe', NULL, 0, '2026-01-31 08:09:13', '2026-01-31 08:09:13'),
(3, 3, 'text', 'ha bahi abhi hi test kar rha hoon 1:53 me', NULL, 0, '2026-01-31 08:23:44', '2026-01-31 08:23:44'),
